    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "3336c585-4f0d-436a-9bc9-996f95135077",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* Istanbul hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions, guided tours \u0026amp; entrance fees included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional local guide\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Istanbul\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in Turkey\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "53ebfaa4-5313-4f11-8a7a-412e9214de63",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights on bed and breakfast basis at the 4* Barcel\u00F3 Istanbul. Located in the heart of the city in the iconic Taksim Square, facilities at the hotel include a restaurant, bar and spa and all rooms are en suite with air conditioning.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "ed85ae6f-6463-448e-ad7a-0cf113bb7497",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Istanbul\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBlue Mosque\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHagia Sophia\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EChurch of St Saviour in Chora\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPierre Loti Caf\u00E9\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBosphorus cruise\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESpice Bazaar\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETopkapi Palace \u0026amp; the Fruit Room of Ahmet II\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUnderground Cistern\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECovered Bazaar\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDolmabah\u00E7e Palace\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "52a8b520-6f15-4cc8-8007-0be88d0e9b1f",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe Hippodrome - originally constructed around AD 200 by Septimius Severus, in AD 330 it was rebuilt on a larger scale by Constantine\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ES\u00FCleymaniye Mosque - one of the grandest and most beautiful of the Ottoman mosques, it crowns one of Istanbul\u0026#39;s seven hills and dominates the Golden Horn providing a landmark for the entire city\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETroy \u0026amp; Gallipoli - by combining with a 2 night stay in Canakkale, explore the battlefields of the tragic Allied invasion of Gallipoli and the UNESCO World Heritage site of Troy, the setting of the Trojan War\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "93db7141-6140-4955-a705-42bb98d41b0b",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Istanbul\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Blue Mosque, Hagia Sophia, Church of St Saviour in Chora \u0026amp; Pierre Loti Caf\u00E9\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMeet our guide for a tour of the old city \u2013 head to the Sultanahmet district in the heart of historic Old Istanbul to tour the Blue Mosque, the masterwork of the 17th century Ottoman architect Sedefk\u00E2r Mehmet Aga, with its six minarets and cascade of domes \u2013 with its wide, flat dome the Byzantine masterpiece of Hagia Sophia was a daring engineering feat in the 6th century and architects still marvel at the building\u0026#39;s many innovations \u2013 built in the 11th century, the Church of St Saviour in Chora contains a wonderfully preserved collection of Byzantine mosaics and frescoes \u2013 take a cable car to the famous Pierre Loti Caf\u00E9 named after the French novelist Julien Viaud, who was more popularly known as Pierre Loti, with time to enjoy tea and simit, a traditional Turkish bread, and enjoy amazing views of the Golden Horn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Bosphorus cruise \u0026amp; Spice Bazaar\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EExplore the Asian part of the city and enjoy a cruise on the Bosphorus \u2013 board the boat at Sariyer, a charming fishing village where the Bosphorus meets the Black Sea, and enjoy a perfect vantage point to see the Sultan\u2019s palaces, Rumeli Fortress, the mansions and modern villas forming the elegant part of the city with lunch and a visit to the Spice Bazaar also included.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Topkapi Palace, Underground Cistern \u0026amp; Covered Bazaar\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFull day in Istanbul with our guide \u2013 Topkapi Palace, home to the Ottoman sultans for nearly 400 years and the heart of the vast Ottoman Empire, is today a museum displaying the Imperial Treasury with wonderful collections of Islamic precious objects and of Chinese porcelain and the site of the Fruit Room of Ahmet II adorned with fruit and floral paintings \u2013 the Underground Cistern, built in the 6th century and re-discovered in 1545, supplied water throughout the city during the Byzantine and Ottoman times and was used to water the gardens of Topkapi Palace \u2013 the Covered Bazaar of Istanbul, with 60 alleyways and 3,000 shops, is the oldest and largest in the world.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Dolmabah\u00E7e Palace\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBuilt by Sultan Abd\u00FCl Mecit in 1856, the extravagant opulence of Dolmabah\u00E7e Palace belies the fact that it was built at a time when the Ottoman Empire was in decline \u2013 transfer to the airport for our scheduled flight home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
